<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg within-feather Turing wavelength of Anas platyrhynchos at 378.4 µm (Pass 2) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The pass-2 GIF is the CC BY-SA drake. A fixed-scale inset grows from faint bars to saturated bars, and the plumage is darkened by the same field. cv_sim_similarity is 94.5 against that photograph. It is still a portrait plus a magnified vane, not a micrograph of mallard barbs at 378 µm, so the score stays below 90." ;
